{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:56:04+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:56:04+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Kingspan Group plc","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"Ireland","city":"Kingscourt","website":"https://www.kingspan.com","employees":27450,"summary":"Kingspan Group plc, together with its subsidiaries, provides insulation and building envelope solutions in Western and Southern Europe, Central and Northern Europe, the Americas, and internationally. It operates through two segments: Insulated Building Envelopes, and Advnsys. The Insulated Building Envelopes segment provides advanced energy-saving solutions for roofs, walls, and floors, delivering building solutions for energy efficiency in both new build and renovation applications across all building types. The Advnsys segment designs and manufactures bespoke critical infrastructure solutions, primarily focused on data centres, ventilation, and daylighting, offering high-performance systems that deliver energy efficient lighting, airflow, cooling, and ventilation for both new build and renovation projects in data centres and commercial buildings. The company offers a comprehensive suite of products, including insulated panels, insulation boards, roofing and waterproofing solutions, structural steel products and system, facades, ceiling systems, raised access floors, daylighting solutions, and water management technologies. It also provides solutions such as PowerPanel integrated solar roofing, QuadCore LEC insulated panels, Kooltherm insulation boards, and a range of lower embodied carbon and bio-based materials. Additionally, the company is involved in developing circular economy solutions, including product takeback and recycling schemes, and offers digital infrastructure, smoke management, and ventilation systems. Kingspan Group plc was founded in 1965 and is based in Kingscourt, Ireland.","exchange":"Irish","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Kingspan Group plc, avec ses filiales, fournit des solutions d'isolation et d'enveloppe de bâtiment en Europe occidentale et méridionale, en Europe centrale et du Nord, en Amérique et à l'international. Il opère à travers deux segments: les enveloppes de bâtiment isolées et Advnsys. Le segment des enveloppes de bâtiment isolées fournit des solutions avancées d'économie d'énergie pour les toits, les murs et les sols, fournissant des solutions de construction pour l'efficacité énergétique dans les applications de nouvelle construction et de rénovation dans tous les types de bâtiments."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":16499305472,"shares_outstanding":180025148,"trailing_pe":24.375,"forward_pe":16.609009,"price_to_book":3.468569,"ev_to_ebitda":16.223,"ev_to_revenue":2.039,"dividend_yield":0.0058999998,"payout_ratio":0.14770001,"beta_yahoo":1.273},"targets":{"current_price":91.65,"mean":125.16667,"median":127.0,"high":150.0,"low":96.0,"n_analysts":15,"reco_mean":1.53333,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-08-07"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":2801800000,"ex_dividend":"2026-09-03","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.15810001,"institutions_pct":0.5875,"institutions_float_pct":0.69782996,"institutions_n":431,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":1877,"value":172027,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.028499998},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":4000,"value":366600,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"AMERICAN FUNDS INSURANCE SERIES-Eupac Fund","pct":0.0397,"shares":7254788,"value":664901331,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":17.506401},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.012200001,"shares":2239572,"value":205256777,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0098},{"name":"Fidelity Rutland S